{"name": "On This Day", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  On This Day — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"cf0902a5f1\";color-scheme:light dark;--accent:#5e5ce6}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f2f7;color:#111}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#000;color:#eee}.head{background:rgba(20,20,22,.92)}.item{background:#1c1c1e}.tab{color:#888}}\n.head{position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(242,242,247,.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(12px);padding:14px 16px 0;z-index:5}\nh1{font-size:20px;margin:0}\n.date{font-size:13px;opacity:.6;margin:2px 0 8px}\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:10px}\n.tab{flex:none;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:18px;background:none;color:#777;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:0;white-space:nowrap}\n.tab.on{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.wrap{padding:6px 16px 24px}\n.item{background:#fff;border-radius:13px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:9px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.07);display:flex;gap:12px}\n.year{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);min-width:46px}\n.txt{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45}\n.txt a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.thumb{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover;flex:none}\n#status{padding:16px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;opacity:.7}\n@media(min-width:768px){body{max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}}\n</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"head\"><h1>📜 On This Day</h1><div class=\"date\" id=\"date\"></div><div class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\"></div>\n<script>\nvar TABS=[['Events','events'],['Births','births'],['Deaths','deaths'],['Holidays','holidays']];\nvar active=0,data=null;\nfunction el(i){return document.getElementById(i)}\nfunction setStatus(t){var s=el('status');s.style.display=t?'block':'none';s.textContent=t||''}\nvar now=new Date();\nvar MM=String(now.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0'),DD=String(now.getDate()).padStart(2,'0');\nel('date').textContent=now.toLocaleDateString(undefined,{month:'long',day:'numeric'});\n\nfunction renderTabs(){var T=el('tabs');T.innerHTML='';TABS.forEach(function(t,i){var b=document.createElement('button');b.className='tab'+(i===active?' on':'');b.textContent=t[0];b.onclick=function(){active=i;render()};T.appendChild(b)})}\n\nfunction loadAll(){\n  if(!window.myllmFetch){setStatus('This app needs network access — enable it in Settings.');return}\n  setStatus('Looking up '+el('date').textContent+'…');\n  myllmFetch('https://api.wikimedia.org/feed/v1/wikipedia/en/onthisday/all/'+MM+'/'+DD,\n    {headers:{'Api-User-Agent':'MyLLMos/1.0 (https://opticell-limited.com/myllm)'}})\n  .then(function(r){\n    if(!r||!r.ok)throw new Error('HTTP '+((r&&r.status)||'?'));\n    data=JSON.parse(r.body);setStatus('');render();\n  }).catch(function(e){setStatus('Couldn’t load history: '+e.message)});\n}\n\nfunction render(){\n  renderTabs();var W=el('wrap');W.innerHTML='';if(!data)return;\n  var list=(data[TABS[active][1]]||[]).slice();\n  list.sort(function(a,b){return (b.year||0)-(a.year||0)});\n  if(!list.length){W.innerHTML='<div style=\"opacity:.5;text-align:center;padding:30px\">Nothing listed for today.</div>';return}\n  list.forEach(function(ev){\n    var page=ev.pages&&ev.pages[0];\n    var url=page&&page.content_urls&&page.content_urls.desktop&&page.content_urls.desktop.page;\n    var thumb=page&&page.thumbnail&&page.thumbnail.source;\n    var c=document.createElement('div');c.className='item';\n    var inner='<div class=\"year\">'+(ev.year?ev.year:'•')+'</div><div class=\"txt\">'+\n      (url?'<a href=\"'+url+'\" target=\"_top\" rel=\"noopener\">'+esc(ev.text)+'</a>':esc(ev.text))+'</div>';\n    if(thumb)inner+='<img class=\"thumb\" src=\"'+esc(thumb)+'\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.remove()\">';\n    c.innerHTML=inner;W.appendChild(c);\n  });\n}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/\"/g,'&quot;')}\nrenderTabs();loadAll();\n</script></body></html>\n", "kind": "html", "iconSymbol": "calendar", "iconColor": "indigo"}